'''Nebaaru-kun''' (ねば～る君) is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Nebaaru-kun and Nyanpazuru Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 4.7 Update|Version 4.7]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Nebaaru-kun
|appearance = [[Nebaaru-kun and Nyanpazuru Collaboration Event]]
|image = E 241.png
|money drop = 1,000円 - 3,950円
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy has high health, decent damage, long range and a 75% chance to [[Slow|slow]] your cats for 3 seconds. However, this seemingly tough reputation gets shattered due to his somewhat long attack rate.

